{"id":"746021e49bce8345","group":"58","path":"58/batch01/58-df-zfc-topo8-stone-space.md","title":"ZFC Topo8 Stone Space","display":"df-zfc-topo8-stone-space — ZFC Topo8 Stone Space","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-topo8-stone-space","aliases":["58-df-zfc-topo8-stone-space"],"display":"df-zfc-topo8-stone-space — ZFC Topo8 Stone Space","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","[[../batch13/58-df-zfc-poset-boolean-ultrafilter.md]]","[[../batch12/58-df-zfc-poset-boolean-algebra.md]]","[[../batch10/58-df-zfc-top5-topological-space.md]]","[[../batch18/58-df-zfc-top-base.md]]","[[../batch13/58-df-zfc-top7-clopen-set.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-topo8-stone-space"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-topo8-stone-space</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-topo8-stone-space — ZFC Topo8 Stone Space"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md\">../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"7be50e9501572e41\" href=\"?note=7be50e9501572e41\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-zfc-poset-boolean-ultrafilter.md\">../batch13/58-df-zfc-poset-boolean-ultrafilter.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"44ab18b3631aa4ec\" href=\"?note=44ab18b3631aa4ec\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-zfc-poset-boolean-algebra.md\">../batch12/58-df-zfc-poset-boolean-algebra.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"74086485fba8d86f\" href=\"?note=74086485fba8d86f\" title=\"../batch10/58-df-zfc-top5-topological-space.md\">../batch10/58-df-zfc-top5-topological-space.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"5b5ecc27cb1d76ae\" href=\"?note=5b5ecc27cb1d76ae\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-zfc-top-base.md\">../batch18/58-df-zfc-top-base.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"da2c915c953b62ca\" href=\"?note=da2c915c953b62ca\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-zfc-top7-clopen-set.md\">../batch13/58-df-zfc-top7-clopen-set.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B,X,\\tau\\in V\">\\(B,X,\\tau\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcPosetBooleanAlgebra}_S\\subseteq V^7\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcPosetBooleanAlgebra}_S\\subseteq V^7\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"44ab18b3631aa4ec\" href=\"?note=44ab18b3631aa4ec\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-zfc-poset-boolean-algebra.md\">../batch12/58-df-zfc-poset-boolean-algebra.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcPosetBooleanUltrafilter}_S\\subseteq V^8\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcPosetBooleanUltrafilter}_S\\subseteq V^8\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"7be50e9501572e41\" href=\"?note=7be50e9501572e41\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-zfc-poset-boolean-ultrafilter.md\">../batch13/58-df-zfc-poset-boolean-ultrafilter.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTop5TopologicalSpace}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTop5TopologicalSpace}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"74086485fba8d86f\" href=\"?note=74086485fba8d86f\" title=\"../batch10/58-df-zfc-top5-topological-space.md\">../batch10/58-df-zfc-top5-topological-space.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTopBase}_S,\\mathrm{ZfcTop7ClopenSet}_S\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTopBase}_S,\\mathrm{ZfcTop7ClopenSet}_S\\subseteq V^3\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"5b5ecc27cb1d76ae\" href=\"?note=5b5ecc27cb1d76ae\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-zfc-top-base.md\">../batch18/58-df-zfc-top-base.md</a>, <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"da2c915c953b62ca\" href=\"?note=da2c915c953b62ca\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-zfc-top7-clopen-set.md\">../batch13/58-df-zfc-top7-clopen-set.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTopo8StoneSpace}_S\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTopo8StoneSpace}_S\\subseteq V^3\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}topo8\\text{-}stone\\text{-}space}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcTopo8StoneSpace}_S(X,\\tau,B)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\exists\\leq_B,\\wedge_B,\\vee_B,\\neg_B,0_B,1_B\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{ZfcPosetBooleanAlgebra}_S\n(B,\\leq_B,\\wedge_B,\\vee_B,\\neg_B,0_B,1_B)\n\\land X=\\bigl\\{U\\subseteq B\\mid\n\\mathrm{ZfcPosetBooleanUltrafilter}_S\n(U,B,\\leq_B,\\wedge_B,\\vee_B,\\neg_B,0_B,1_B)\\bigr\\}\n\\land\\mathrm{ZfcTop5TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\exists\\mathcal B\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathcal B=\\bigl\\{\\{U\\in X\\mid b\\in U\\}:b\\in B\\bigr\\}\n\\land\\mathrm{ZfcTopBase}_S(\\mathcal B,X,\\tau)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{31mm}{}\\land\\forall W\\in\\mathcal B\\;\n\\mathrm{ZfcTop7ClopenSet}_S(X,\\tau,W)\\Bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}topo8\\text{-}stone\\text{-}space}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcTopo8StoneSpace}_S(X,\\tau,B)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\exists\\leq_B,\\wedge_B,\\vee_B,\\neg_B,0_B,1_B\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{ZfcPosetBooleanAlgebra}_S\n(B,\\leq_B,\\wedge_B,\\vee_B,\\neg_B,0_B,1_B)\n\\land X=\\bigl\\{U\\subseteq B\\mid\n\\mathrm{ZfcPosetBooleanUltrafilter}_S\n(U,B,\\leq_B,\\wedge_B,\\vee_B,\\neg_B,0_B,1_B)\\bigr\\}\n\\land\\mathrm{ZfcTop5TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\exists\\mathcal B\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathcal B=\\bigl\\{\\{U\\in X\\mid b\\in U\\}:b\\in B\\bigr\\}\n\\land\\mathrm{ZfcTopBase}_S(\\mathcal B,X,\\tau)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{31mm}{}\\land\\forall W\\in\\mathcal B\\;\n\\mathrm{ZfcTop7ClopenSet}_S(X,\\tau,W)\\Bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The points are Boolean-algebra ultrafilters, and the sets determined by membership of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b\\in B\">\\(b\\in B\\)</span> form a clopen base.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch13/58-df-zfc-poset-boolean-ultrafilter.md","status":"resolved","id":"7be50e9501572e41","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch13/58-df-zfc-poset-boolean-ultrafilter.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch12/58-df-zfc-poset-boolean-algebra.md","status":"resolved","id":"44ab18b3631aa4ec","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch12/58-df-zfc-poset-boolean-algebra.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch10/58-df-zfc-top5-topological-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"74086485fba8d86f","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch10/58-df-zfc-top5-topological-space.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch18/58-df-zfc-top-base.md","status":"resolved","id":"5b5ecc27cb1d76ae","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch18/58-df-zfc-top-base.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch13/58-df-zfc-top7-clopen-s